message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Ruri Atlas"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nakatsugawa
    given-names: Masahiro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3224-0103"
abstract: >-
  A zero-install demo of Japanese and English semantic search that runs entirely in the browser (WebGPU with a WASM fallback): sentence embeddings drawn as a glowing 3-D map, a cross-encoder reranker, switchable embedding models, bilingual maps, and a prompt-injection viewer.
repository-code: "https://github.com/masahiroid/ruri-atlas"
url: "https://huggingface.co/spaces/masahiroid/ruri-atlas"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - semantic-search
  - webgpu
  - japanese
  - embeddings
  - visualization
  - rag
